From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:48:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] backport: deps: Update deps with advisories

Updates dependencies with advisories.

Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 0928b944d0a150e4fbc47ec22c43cb8172cc6160)

----

Fork note: backported onto Servo v0.6.0 for the ohos-v0.6 branch. A commit of upstream's release/v0.6 branch after v0.6.0, taken unchanged so that the next v0.6.x release supersedes it: v0.6.0's lock file fails cargo-deny in test-tidy.

Validation: On the final stack, at its tip: `./mach test-tidy` (including cargo-deny), `./mach test-scripts`, `./mach clippy --locked -- -- --deny warnings`, the crown build (checked-release, -D warnings, crown built for Rust 1.97.1), `./mach test-unit --profile checked-release` with and without `--doc`, and the OpenHarmony checked-release builds of both flavors with -D warnings, which make signed HAPs, pass; release builds of it with both engines ran the whole WPT suite. cargo-deny passes at the stack's tip, where plain v0.6.0 has 24 findings.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; the agent cherry-picked upstream commit 0928b944d0a without code changes and added the fork-style part of this message below the dashed line: fork note, Validation and these trailers)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
